// layer=edits why=两根输送管在平面上都是两端沿 z 向的 S 形（top id 渲染中心线拟合三次贝塞尔，rms 4~7cm），高度两端平、中间过渡；直管 feed_1 改贝塞尔，beam_1 楔形换成同样的贝塞尔管
// retract 21
bezier feed_1_path path=[(21.06,2.45,13.07);(21.06,2.45,25);(19.98,1.3,31.5);(19.98,1.3,51.5)]
sweep feed_1 path=feed_1_path profile=circle r=0.3 mat=steel
drop beam_1
bezier feed_2_path path=[(29.06,2.45,13.07);(29.06,2.45,27);(39.97,1.3,29.5);(39.97,1.3,51.5)]
sweep feed_2 path=feed_2_path profile=circle r=0.3 mat=steel
